That is not human flourishing; that is digital slavery!

5
00:00:44,330 --> 00:00:55,780
When we build a 24/7 cloud guardian, we aren't creating a lazy shortcut—we are redeeming precious human hours for deep study, prayer, creative design, and sacred rest!

6
00:00:56,680 --> 00:00:57,880
Amen, Sarah!

7
00:00:57,880 --> 00:01:04,310
And the first barrier we have to smash to achieve that freedom is what I call the 'Active Tab Trap.'

